@title Cabinet plate: EMC view of the drive example (classes, keep-clear bands, hot spots, exposure map)
@area Cabinet
# Ctrl+K "EMC view on the plate" (or the EMC button in the Cabinet toolbar, under More in a narrow window) draws the EMC picture flat over the mounting plate.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
shot plate-emc
check_layout
click_text "Exposure map" #1
wait 15
shot plate-emc-exposure
check_layout
